{
  "title": "29th Day",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "اَللّٰهُمَّ غَشِّنِىْ فِيْهِ بِالرَّحْمَةِ، وَ ارْزُقْنِىْ فِيْهِ التَّوْفِيْقَ وَ الْعِصْمَةَ، وَ طَهِّرْ قَلْبِىْ مِنْ غَيَاهِبِ التُّهْمَةِ، يَا رَحِيْمًا بِعِبَادِهِ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ.\nALLAAHUMMA GHASH-SHENEE FEEHE BIR-RAHMATE WAR-ZUQNEE FEEHIT TAWFEEQA WAL-I'SMATA WA TAHHIR QALBEE MIN GHAYAAHEBIT TOHMATE YAA RAHEEMAN BE-E'BAADEHIL MOA-MENEENA.\nO Allah, on this day, (please) spread out mercy over me, provide me with success and protection (against sinning), and cleanse my heart from the murk of doubt. O He Who is merciful to His faithful servants!"
}
